whisper: A small pet shelter: kinds of things, lists, and commands that give back answers.
whisper: Run it with: py -3 cosmonova.py run examples/pets.cosmos

a pet has:
  name (text)
  age (a number)
  tricks (a list of text)
and the universe said i love you

genesis:
  set shelter to a list of pets
  add pet called with ("Rex", 3) to shelter
  add pet called with ("Mittens", 12) to shelter
  add pet called with ("Bubbles", 1) to shelter
  add "sit" to the tricks of item 1 of shelter
  add "roll over" to the tricks of item 1 of shelter

  for each pet in shelter:
    scrawl the name of pet, " is ", the age of pet, " and knows: ", the tricks of pet

  scrawl "Oldest: ", the name of oldest in shelter
  scrawl "Ages added up: ", total age of shelter
  set item 3 of shelter to pet called with ("Goldie", 2)
  remove item 2 from shelter
  scrawl "Left: ", names in shelter
  if names in shelter contains "Goldie": scrawl "Goldie found a home here."
and the universe said i love you

to pet called, given name (text) and age (a number), returning a pet:
  set made to conjure a pet
  set the name of made to name
  set the age of made to age
  return made
and the universe said i love you

to oldest in, given pets (a list of pets), returning a pet:
  set best to item 1 of pets
  for each pet in pets:
    if the age of pet exceeds the age of best: set best to pet
  return best
and the universe said i love you

to total age of, given pets (a list of pets), returning a number:
  set total to 0
  for each pet in pets: set total to total plus the age of pet
  return total
and the universe said i love you

to names in, given pets (a list of pets), returning a list of text:
  set found to a list of text
  for each pet in pets: add the name of pet to found
  return found
and the universe said i love you
